[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13142.469, "timestamp": "03:39:02", "text": "正确的？哦，当你快用完的时候"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13146.79, "timestamp": "03:39:06", "text": "我觉得，就时间而言，这件事本身也至关重要。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13149.349, "timestamp": "03:39:09", "text": "当你……是的。是的。那是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13151.99, "timestamp": "03:39:11", "text": "像闪着红光一样。呃，我不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13153.99, "timestamp": "03:39:13", "text": "我认为你必须尽快进入，否则你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13157.59, "timestamp": "03:39:17", "text": "可能会死。哦，我觉得就像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13159.349, "timestamp": "03:39:19", "text": "当你打开保险库的那一刻，它可能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13164.12, "timestamp": "03:39:24", "text": "对打开它的人来说很危险"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13167.389, "timestamp": "03:39:27", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13170.07, "timestamp": "03:39:30", "text": "它。我还没试过打开。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13172.67, "timestamp": "03:39:32", "text": "哦，抱紧它，也抱紧墙壁吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13176.469, "timestamp": "03:39:36", "text": "哦，不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13181.83, "timestamp": "03:39:41", "text": "哦，我死了。妈的。他妈的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13185.91, "timestamp": "03:39:45", "text": "我的天啊，你……哦，该死。期待与您全面见面。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13189.67, "timestamp": "03:39:49", "text": "错误。等等，你死了吗？不，我没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13192.469, "timestamp": "03:39:52", "text": "死。我意识到我好像要……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13195.03, "timestamp": "03:39:55", "text": "死。我当时真是滑溜溜的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13198.39, "timestamp": "03:39:58", "text": "然后我看到"}]